/Title (PROJECT NAME: QUICKTUBE LIVE SEARCH WEB APP PROJECT PURPOSE:  QuickTube is a responsive web application that allows users to search for YouTube videos and see results instantly as they type. It solves the problem of slow, traditional search experiences by providing real-time suggestions and quick access to video content. This tool is useful for users who want fast browsing and for beginner developers learning API integration and dynamic UI updates. SCOPE:  Included: live search functionality, video thumbnails, titles, channel names, and responsive design.  Not included: user accounts, video uploading, comments, or advanced filtering features. DELIVERABLES:  A fully functional web app with live search, styled UI, responsive layout, and deployed website link.)
/Dest [9 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Next 162 0 R
>>
